{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-groebner-basis","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:groebner-basis","kind":"definition","title":"Gröbner--Shirshov basis","uses":["papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-admissible-system","papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-monomial-basis","papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-leading-term-data"],"cites":["references/bokut2005","references/leitnerpawloski2004"],"tags":["groebner-basis"],"leanRef":"ugb:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.IsGrobnerShirshovBasis","text":"groebner-basis.md","leanSource":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/groebner-basis.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:groebner-basis\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code> be a commutative ring with unity, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-algebra which\nis free as an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-module and without quasi-zeros, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(B, &#x3C;)</code> an\n<a href=\"#def:admissible-system\">admissible system</a>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I</code> a two-sided\nideal in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>.</p>\n<p>A set of generators\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G = \\{g_\\gamma \\mid \\gamma \\in \\Gamma\\}</code> for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I</code> is a\n<strong>Gröbner--Shirshov basis</strong> with respect to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(B, &#x3C;)</code> if for every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h \\in I</code> we have a\nrepresentation</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  h = \\sum_{k \\in K} \\lambda_k\\, u_k \\cdot g_{\\gamma_k} \\cdot v_k</code></pre>\n<p>for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K</code> an index set, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma_k \\in \\Gamma</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_k \\in R^*</code>,\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_k, v_k \\in B</code>, such that\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{LM}(u_k \\cdot g_{\\gamma_k} \\cdot v_k) \\leq \\mathrm{LM}(h)</code>\nwhenever <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u_k \\cdot g_{\\gamma_k} \\cdot v_k \\neq 0</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/groebner-basis.md","heading":"Definition","number":"2.3.2"}
